<title>USA: Washington Mutual ups Q3 div to $0.24.</title>
<headline>Washington Mutual ups Q3 div to $0.24.</headline>
<dateline>SEATTLE 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount	  $0.24		     $0.23</p>
<p> Pay	     Nov 15</p>
<p> Record	  Oct 31</p>
<p>NOTE: Full name of company is Washington Mutual Inc.</p>
<p>Company's board of directors also declared dividends of $0.57 per share on the Series C preferred stock, $1.50 per share on the Series D preferred stock and $0.475 per share on the Series E preferred stock.</p>
